      "q": "If $\\begin{bmatrix} a & 2 \\\\ 3 & b \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 5 & c \\\\ d & 7 \\end{bmatrix}$, what are the values of $a$, $b$, $c$, and $d$?",
